f-term\">27-df-term</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Imp}:\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\to\\mathcal{P}(\\mathrm{Term}_n)\">\\(\\mathrm{Imp}:\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\to\\mathcal{P}(\\mathrm{Term}_n)\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Imp}(f)\\coloneqq\\{T\\in\\mathrm{Term}_n\\mid \\forall a\\in\\mathbb{B}^{n}\\,(T(a)=1\\to f(a)=1)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Imp}(f)\\coloneqq\\{T\\in\\mathrm{Term}_n\\mid \\forall a\\in\\mathbb{B}^{n}\\,(T(a)=1\\to f(a)=1)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Equivalently, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\in\\mathrm{Imp}(f)\">\\(T\\in\\mathrm{Imp}(f)\\)</span> iff <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\leq f\">\\(T\\leq f\\)</span> pointwise.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-boolfunc","status":"resolved","id":"5d10aed668d85817","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-boolfunc]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"e065076d6b51508e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-term]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-boolfunc","status":"resolved","id":"5d10aed668d85817","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$ (Boolean function, see [[27-df-boolfunc]])","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"e065076d6b51508e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Term}_n$ (Boolean terms, see [[27-df-term]])","embed":f